Chapter: MapUndefined

 The `map` name used to have a type-level-only binding with no runtime
 implementation: it type-checked and then died late at codegen with an
 unresolved-call error (CDX2040). The binding was removed, so a
 reference to `map` must now fail early at name resolution as an
 undefined name. Use list-map instead.

Section: Body

  inc : Integer -> Integer
  inc (n) = n + 1

  opening : [Console] Nothing = act
    print-line-uni (show (list-length (map inc [1, 2, 3])))
  end

